OL,3,GNEWSAGarry Bridges is new Manchester
OL,4,ACity Council boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Garry Bridges has been
OL,7,Felected as the new Manchester City
OL,8,FCouncil leader.
OL,10,FHe won a vote to become Manchester
OL,11,FLabour group leader on Tuesday night
OL,12,Fand is set to be formally appointed as
OL,13,Fcouncil leader on Thursday.
OL,15,FRepresenting the Old Moat ward in south
OL,16,FManchester, Bridges previously served
OL,17,Fas deputy council leader under Bev
OL,18,FCraig before she was elected as mayor
OL,19,Fof Greater Manchester in July.
OL,21,FHe has acted as interim council leader
OL,22,Fsince Craig left the town hall.
